Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:04.67,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was do right things
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:09.73,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to be the king, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:14.55,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was save your life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:20.18,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to grab a knife, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:27.71,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Tearless, fearless, burning, burning
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:30.96,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}You tell me what have I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:34.88,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Still wandering in the deep mist
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:40.74,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, slip and fall
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:43.47,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I will never look away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:49.47,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:53.57,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all outside the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:56.76,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Live to die another day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.29,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I don't want anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:02.53,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I'm just here to…
